<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="04">
<name>Driveline/Axle</name>
<section id="1000K_S0015" variety="S0015">
<name>Differential</name>
<ttl id="1000K_S0015_744ZW_T00A7" variety="T00A7">
<name>Active Torque Control 4WD System</name>
<para id="RM000001XLV005X" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="370CO-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000001XLV005X_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___00005I200000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Control System CAN Communication Function Inspection</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs via [Diagnosis] → [Vehicle Diagnosis/CAN Bus Diagnosis] → [Diagnostic Function/Communication Error DTC Check].</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If DTCs are output, refer to CAN Communication Section (<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005S001MX"/>).</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication Section</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000MJ9007X"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the DTCs are output again.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTCs are output, refer to the DTC Chart (<xref label="Seep03" href="X36100000HW008D"/>).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Symptom Check and Reproduction Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>If the symptom cannot be confirmed or reproduced, go to A</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.48in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Symptom cannot be confirmed or reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For problem simulation, refer to <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Problem Simulation</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the symptom chart, refer to <xref label="Seep05" href="X36100000HZ008D"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Identify the malfunctioning part.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>Malfunctioning part not identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry>
<ptxt>Malfunctioning part identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 8</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM00000068G00EX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM00000068800EX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>